Target 5 requirement 6 explicitly requires implementing WithRecvTimeout in client/callopt/streamcall:

**Required per task**: "Stream call option WithRecvTimeout (client/callopt/streamcall): WithRecvTimeout(d time.Duration) Option — sets recv timeout for the stream at call level. The timeout value is stored in o.StreamOptions.RecvTimeout."

This is separate from WithStreamRecvTimeout in option_stream.go. Both are required by the task specification, even if their behavior seems similar. Create client/callopt/streamcall/recv_timeout.go with:

```go
package streamcall

import (
    "time"
    "github.com/cloudwego/kitex/client/callopt"
)

func WithRecvTimeout(d time.Duration) callopt.Option {
    return callopt.Option{F: func(o *callopt.CallOptions) {
        // Set recv timeout for this specific stream call
        o.StreamOptions.RecvTimeout = d
    }}
}
```

Complete Target 5 by implementing this required function.

